# Local-only environment file. NOTHING SECRET BELONGS IN HERE.
#
# This file used to carry a live GEMINI_API_KEY and it was committed to a
# public repository, so that key must be treated as burned and rotated.
#
# Provider keys live only in Supabase Edge Function secrets and are read by
# supabase/functions/ai-proxy. The browser bundle never sees one.
#
# For a local checkout, copy .env.example to .env.local and fill in the two
# VITE_SUPABASE_* values. .env.local is git-ignored from now on.
